{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Gyaarah Gyaarah","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ceYC09Vl6hgEHIQkGiWrN4AOC2x.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7PnFIa4f2QrKVAQHoJbEIKiCAtR.jpg","description":"Three cops defy the rules of time to investigate and deliver justice in a series of cold cases. How far will they go as they work from within the corrupt system to bring the criminals to book?\n\nRated A · Ended · First aired 9 Aug 2024 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: Dharmatic Entertainment, Sikhya Entertainment · Network: ZEE5\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Officer Yug tries solving a cold case with the support of senior cop Vamika. But in a twist of fate, a defunct walkie-talkie springs to life at 11:11 PM, connecting Yug to a past Officer Shaurya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aL1nPHB6rwldSz6ftGGWWFi9QRD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Aditi's abduction and murder case takes a chilling turn. Amidst flashbacks of suspects and an evil nurse, the plot thickens. The connection with Officer Shaurya at 11:11 PM hints at altering the past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5H1qnj0a8cuByum0d0hb6PLCV3j.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Vamika pushes the Nurse for a confession on the case, the team together are assigned to solve the \"Tie and Die\" killings. Will Yug be able to blur the lines of past & present to serve justice?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kCSSHbfLY9e2clqpHzeJHB31c8Y.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Vamika receives a call from Yug when speaking to the victim's daughter, confirming that he is a survivor of the Tie and Die serial killing case. In '90, Shaurya captures the suspected killer based on Yug's tip.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xhwq5sfwcdHJJoP6W51XSFXgRp6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In 1990, Palak, a dancer set to meet Shaurya, travels alone, only to encounter a driver named Brahmdutt.  In 2016, Yug awaits updates on Palak’s murder case from Shaurya, only to be kept hanging.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1tEvaqXvXXGggZi2yGTrWZMMknw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9HeWFhcmFoLUd5YWFyYWgtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjQtLSUyOS8.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In 1990, a child gets abused by his mother, unravelling patterns of the 'Tie and Die' killer’s method. In 2016, Vamika's search leads her to a hospital room only to find Brahmdutt's son, Birju. A trail of attacks follows.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4QfNTcZREZXCOfIF3tbDgynidw3.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkv